  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1.0, 2026-10-15. DbAdapter: provider-agnostic (any DbConnection), truly async execution and reading, safer type conversion; constructor no longer takes IDbDataAdapter. HttpAdapter: URL-encoded query parameters, files sent without explicit Content-Type, shared connection pool, case-insensitive JSON, adjustable timeout. BlobAdapter: fixed UpdateFile overwrite, stores file Content-Type. General bug fixes and consistent async style.",
